Package: dogecoin-gpenode
Version: __VERSION__-1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: __ARCH__
Depends: adduser, systemd | systemd-sysv
Conflicts: dogecoind, dogecoin-qt
Replaces: dogecoind
Maintainer: The Retarded Elon <noreply@gopastearth.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/TheRetardedElon/Dogecoin-GPENode
Description: Dogecoin GPENode headless node (Core Pro consensus)
 Headless Dogecoin node for operators (dogecoind + dogecoin-cli + gpenode-ops).
 Same mainnet consensus as Core Pro; no Qt desktop wallet GUI.
 .
 Installs a systemd service (dogecoin-gpenode), generates a unique
 localhost RPC password on first install, and defaults to a dump-oriented
 conf profile (prune, wallet disabled).
 .
 RPC binds to 127.0.0.1 only. Do not expose port 22555 to the internet.
